      <activity id="9f4fcd9a-37f9-5bb2-978f-0c9dba29d2bc" activityNameId="0e2d1ce1-b115-5d11-ab0d-f6de0cf2fa57" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sulphate pulp, ECF bleached, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sulphate pulp, ECF bleached, at plant
na;
Synonyms: kraft pulp, Kraftzellstoff; 
UUID: 2138b094-4930-3bcc-9625-07e636a24060
This module includes the production of sulphate pulp with the ECF bleaching process - including transports to the pulp mill, wood handling, chemical pulping and bleaching, drying process, energy production on-site, recovery cycles of chemicals and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Data from a finnish database and from several Scandinavian producers used as European average data.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Modern average technology.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Total European market sulphate pulp production in 2000: 9297 kt
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2138b094-4930-3bcc-9625-07e636a24060.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
